===== Flash from DD-WRT =====

If you are using DD-WRT and want to flash to OpenWRT, there are a few caveats: Not every version of DD-WRT can support flash to stock/OpenWRT. My version Aug 10 2024 cannot. I keep getting "Bad trx header" error with either "write openwrt-23.05.4-mvebu-cortexa9
-linksys_wrt1900ac-v1-squashfs-factory.img linux" or use Web UI. After a few attempts, I find a combination of success: upgrade your DD-WRT to another version (mine Sept 02 2024) and use openwrt-21.02.7 instead of 23.05.4. Then it works.


